title: "Scientific Data Pipeline"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
abstract: "Local, tested pipeline from raw open scientific data to validated, versioned, citable datasets: content-addressed raw zone, validation with quarantine, lineage, Parquet and Zarr outputs and FAIR-style releases. Evaluated locally on a small NOAA GHCN-Daily extract."
